<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!-- Grip «DOOM 1993» palette. Same 36 keys as Colors.Dark/Light.xaml — brushes are frozen
         and the whole dictionary is swapped, never merged with another palette.

         Grip.Font.Display is the one non-color key here: Black Ops One (SIL OFL 1.1, vendored
         at Assets/Fonts/BlackOpsOne-Regular.ttf — see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md), an evocation of
         the style, not a copy of DOOM's own proprietary game font.

         NOT independently Wine-verified, unlike everything else in this theme: this is WPF's
         own standard, documented way to reference a private/embedded font (a pack URI plus a
         "#Family Name" fragment). Three different loading techniques were tried here —
         straight off this embedded resource, off a copy extracted to a real file, and via
         GDI's AddFontResourceEx (registration itself confirmed to succeed) plus a plain-name
         lookup — and all three rendered as the default fallback font under this project's
         Wine preview pipeline, with no error at any step along the way. That pattern points to
         a font-enumeration gap in this dotnet+WPF+Wine combination rather than a mistake in
         any one of the three, but it means this line is unverified beyond "it's the officially
         documented syntax and doesn't throw" — check it on a real Windows machine before
         relying on it looking right. -->
    <FontFamily x:Key="Grip.Font.Display">pack://application:,,,/Grip;component/Assets/Fonts/#Black Ops One</FontFamily>
    <!-- Hand-pixelled Grip mark (tools/icons/build_doom_mark.py) — GripMark draws this in
         place of its usual procedural ring whenever this key resolves to something. Plain
         BitmapImage-from-pack-URI loading, unlike the font above: confirmed rendering
         correctly under this project's Wine preview pipeline. -->
    <BitmapImage x:Key="Grip.Mark.PixelImage" UriSource="pack://application:,,,/Grip;component/Assets/Doom/mark-24.png" />
